msgstr "Tsarin Fayil Mara Inganci - Ba a Samu Shigarwar Rajistar Tambayoyi Masu Sanyi Ba"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The initial Slowlog has been ingested.  Post Processing will take place in the background.  You can start analyzing the Details once the status is complete"
msgstr "An karɓi Slowlog na farko.  Za a ci gaba da sarrafa bayanan a baya (background).  Kuna iya fara nazarin Cikakkun Bayanai da zarar matsayin ya kammala"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Post Processing Failed - Database Error"
msgstr "Sarrafawa ta Baya ta Kasa - Kuskuren Rumbun Bayanai"

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "max_execution_time is %d seconds (not unlimited) for this request - a large import could be killed mid-run. Some web servers/proxies (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) enforce their own independent cutoff that this setting cannot override."
msgstr "max_execution_time shine daƙiƙa %d (ba marar iyaka ba) don wannan buƙatar - za a iya katse babban shigowa a tsakiyar aiki. Wasu uwar garken yanar gizo/wakilai (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) suna aiwatar da nasu iyakar lokacin daban wanda wannan saitin ba zai iya sauyawa ba."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "memory_limit is %s (not unlimited) for this request - a very large slow query log can exceed this while it is being read/imported."
msgstr "memory_limit shine %s (ba marar iyaka ba) don wannan buƙatar - babbar rajistar tambayoyi masu sanyi na iya wuce wannan iyaka yayin da ake karantawa/shigo da ita."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "post_max_size (%s) is smaller than upload_max_filesize (%s) - uploads up to the advertised limit will still be rejected."
msgstr "post_max_size (%s) ya yi ƙanƙanta fiye da upload_max_filesize (%s) - har yanzu za a ƙi loda fayilolin da suka kai iyakar da aka nuna."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "upload_max_filesize (%s) is small for a MySQL/MariaDB slow query log, which can easily be hundreds of MB."
msgstr "upload_max_filesize (%s) ya yi ƙanƙanta don rajistar tambayoyi masu sanyi ta MySQL/MariaDB, wadda za ta iya kai ɗaruruwan MB cikin sauƙi."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The uploaded Slowlog file exceeds the server's maximum upload filesize."
msgstr "KUSKURE: Fayil ɗin Slowlog da aka loda ya wuce mafi girman girman fayil da uwar garken ke karɓa."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The Slowlog file upload was interrupted before it finished - please try again."
msgstr "KUSKURE: An katse loda fayil ɗin Slowlog kafin ya kammala - don Allah sake gwadawa."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The server has no temporary folder configured to receive the uploaded Slowlog file."
msgstr "KUSKURE: Uwar garken ba ta da babban fayil na wucin gadi da aka saita don karɓar fayil ɗin Slowlog da aka loda."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The server failed to write the uploaded Slowlog file to disk."
msgstr "KUSKURE: Uwar garken ta kasa rubuta fayil ɗin Slowlog da aka loda zuwa rumbun ajiya."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: A server extension blocked the Slowlog file upload."
msgstr "KUSKURE: Wani kari na uwar garken ya toshe loda fayil ɗin Slowlog."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "ERROR: The Slowlog file upload failed (error code %d)."
msgstr "KUSKURE: Loda fayil ɗin Slowlog ya kasa (lambar kuskure %d)."

