msgstr "Mafi Girman Tsawon Tambaya"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only import the first X characters of the SQL Query from the MySQL Slow Query log."
msgstr "Shigo da haruffan farko X kawai na Tambayar SQL daga rajistar Tambayoyi Masu Sanyi ta MySQL."

