msgstr "Haruffa %d"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Slowlog Table Names [ optional ]"
msgstr "Sunayen Teburin Slowlog [ na zaɓi ]"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Leave Blank for Auto Detection which runs must faster."
msgstr "Bar Shi Fanko don Gano Kai Tsaye wanda ke aiki da sauri sosai."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Gano Teburin Cacti"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Yadda za a bambance teburorin asali na Cacti daga sauran teburorin da aka ambata a cikin rajistar tambayoyi masu sanyi. A matsayin asali yana gano kowane teburi ba tare da rarrabawa ba."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Gano duka teburori (babu rarrabawar 'OTHER TABLES')"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Yi amfani da wannan Rumbun Bayanai na Cacti; tara sauran teburori a matsayin 'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Gano duka teburori; tara teburorin da ba sa cikin jerin da ke ƙasa a matsayin 'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Teburorin da Ake Buƙata"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "Ana amfani da shi ne kawai ta zaɓin 'Gano duka teburori; tara ... a matsayin OTHER TABLES' a sama. Don Allah ba da jerin teburori da aka sani wanda aka raba da sarari don kwatanta. A cikin Linux/UNIX, za ku iya samun jerin teburori ta amfani da wannan umarnin:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>Ana maye gurbin ƙimomin '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', da '<i><b>database</b></i>' da naku ƙimomin."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Iyakokin Loda Fayil"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Iyakokin girman fayil na loda a cikin Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Mafi Girman Girman Fayil na Loda"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Mafi girman girman fayil da uwar garken Apache ɗinku za ta yarda a loda an saita shi zuwa ƙimar da ke dama.  A halin yanzu, ba za ku iya loda fayil da ya fi wannan girma ba.  Idan kuna da rajistocin MySQL Slow da suka fi wannan girma, dole ne ku gyara fayil ɗin <i>php.ini</i> da ke alaƙa da Apache, ku nemo maɓallin <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> sannan ku ƙara ƙimar.  Bayan haka dole ne ku sake kunna Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Mafi Girman Girman Post"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Mafi girman girman da za ku iya aikawa (post) zuwa uwar garken Apache an saita shi zuwa ƙimar da ke dama.  Idan kuna da rajistocin MySQL Slow da suka fi wannan ƙima, dole ne ku gyara fayil ɗin <i>php.ini</i> da ke alaƙa da Apache, ku nemo maɓallin <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> sannan ku ƙara ƙimarsa.  Bayan haka dole ne ku sake kunna Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Mafi Girman Lokacin Aiki"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Tsawon lokaci (cikin daƙiƙu) da aka yarda wannan buƙatar ta yi aiki; 0 na nufin marar iyaka. Wannan ƙarin (plugin) ya riga ya ɗaga shi zuwa marar iyaka don nasa buƙatun, amma uwar garken yanar gizo ko wakilin baya (reverse proxy) a gaban PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) na iya katse buƙatar daban - ba za a iya gano hakan ko sauya shi daga nan ba."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Marar Iyaka"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Iyakar Ƙwaƙwalwar Ajiya"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Adadin ƙwaƙwalwar ajiyar da aka yarda wannan buƙatar ta yi amfani da ita; -1 na nufin marar iyaka. Wannan ƙarin (plugin) ya riga ya ɗaga shi zuwa marar iyaka don nasa buƙatun. Babbar rajistar tambayoyi masu sanyi da ake karantawa/shigo da ita a buƙata guda na iya wuce iyakar da aka ƙayyade."

